OL,3,AArgentina's bid to stop Falklands oil
OL,4,Adrilling rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FArgentina's bid to block an oil
OL,7,Fexploration project near the Falkland
OL,8,FIslands has been rejected by a
OL,9,FUN-backed international tribunal.
OL,11,FThe Argentinian government had called
OL,12,Ffor the Sea Lion venture to be halted
OL,13,Fas it claimed there was an ongoing
OL,14,Fdispute over the sovereignty of the
OL,15,FFalklands, a British overseas
OL,16,Fterritory. The UK has repeatedly
OL,17,Frejected that claim.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
