OL,3,AArgentina's bid to stop Falklands oil
OL,4,Adrilling rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking on Saturday, the president of
OL,7,Fthe International Tribunal for the Law
OL,8,Fof the Sea said it was the wrong court
OL,9,Fto rule on questions of sovereignty.
OL,10,FThe decision was upheld in a vote 18-3.
OL,12,FAfter the ruling, UK Foreign Secretary
OL,13,FEd Miliband and Attorney General Ellie
OL,14,FReeves urged Argentina to "end its
OL,15,Fwider economic pressure" against the
OL,16,Fterritory.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
